<title>SWEDEN: Avesta wins 180 mln skr Spain order.</title>
<headline>Avesta wins 180 mln skr Spain order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-Swedish steel producer Avesta Sheffield said on Friday it had won an order worth around 180 million crowns to supply the tanker plate for four 22,500 dwt chemical tankers to be built in Spain.</p>
<p>Avesta Sheffield, which is 51 percent owned by British Steel, said in a statement its Hot Rolled Plate division in Degerfors had received the order from Spain's state-owned Astilleros Espanoles SA.</p>
<p>The tankers have been ordered by the Stolt-Nielsen shipping company in the United States.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
